// IntroString :
"P2486150012" "Aeon's connection to the Gold Brickers makes something else clear. Wyvern had been targeting them, but seemed to drop that recently. Now they're going after Arachnos, but it looks like they're searching for something. Possibly evidence of that connection. They can't be allowed to find it, and it has to be done without revealing it actually exists. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>That means I'll need another job done by a deniable outside contractor.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1455974060" "Take another deniable job from Marshal Brass"
// SendOffString :
"P4043419201" "I have no special hatred of Wyvern. They help to cull out the weaker villains. However, they've somehow gotten a lot of information on our bases recently. They're searching through files with near impunity. This has me upset. <br><br>They triggered a false radiation alert and forced one base to evacuate. I want you to find why they targeted that base, and then find and defeat every last one of them in there. Report back to me when you're done."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P252487439" "Defeat all Wyvern in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1818943363" "I want you to find why they targeted that base, and then find and defeat every last one of them in there. Report back to me when you're done."

