// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - PTSData 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P179380916" "PTS control computer"
// Description :
"P4050208745" "Secure PTS data"
// InteractBeginString :
"P1169553929" "You access the computer"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4099928398" "You finish accessing the computer"
// InteractActionString :
"P2096386660" "Accessing..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3563972600" "You copied the real schematics of the PTS."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3727936915" "You secured the data about the Power Transfer System."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1094553868" "This, this is too much. This re-defines going too far. Tapping into a demon? All these attacks? The clockwork out here? And now I got it. Thanks to you. I told you Vines was useful. <br><br>Speaking of Vines, did she talk to you? The next thing I need done involves her. Her and WSPDR. Sources on the inside tell me they're going to go live with all that they know. I'd like to see Aeon get what he deserves. But deserve's got nothing to do with it. I can't let that broadcast happen."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3266893380" "My sources inside WSPDR have alerted me to a problem. Amanda Vines has proof about Dr. Aeon's identity. She intends to broadcast it. This cannot be allowed. I'm sending in assault troops, but I know they have guards. Mercenaries. Wyvern, probably. That's where you come in. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I want you to make sure that WSPDR doesn't transmit anything</A>. Once the pressure's on, they'll try to act fast. Broadcast ahead of schedule. You'll have about 90 minutes. After that, either the news will be out of commision, or the news will be out on the airwaves."
// AcceptString :
"P651415598" "Destroy generators to stop transmission"
// SendOffString :
"P2663690888" "We're setting up jamming stations as back-up. Activating them would alert enemies and scramble communications. I'd rather you handled this cleanly. There should be four generators. Some on the roof, some back-ups scattered around. Destroy all of them. That will cut their power. We can then get their evidence at leisure."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2120284946" "Destroy the generators"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P285956712" "Destroy the generators. You only have 90 minutes. <br><br>You're not hesitating, are you?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1783990131" "Amanda's offer sticks in your head. She said she would pay if you let them stay on the air. It's really all up to you, now."

