// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2759292420" "You have destroyed one of the dummy not-yet completed generators."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P770861825" "You destroyed the generators before the broadcast could begin."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P730644708" "WSPDR had enough power to transmit. The only question is how much of the truth got through the jamming?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2452138277" "Good work. We've confiscated all of the evidence. Pinned the whole thing on a Hero assault. No one suspects the truth. Except Ms. Vines. I've had my men have a little 'talk' with her. Discuss her boundaries. What she can and cannot say. Nothing too severe. No marks for the cameras. It should make her even more determined, but reign her in some. She gets to live. <br>Me? I get to crucify Aeon with what you've found. That should keep him in line. For a while. <br>And you? You get paid. Not that you were ever a part of this. Everybody wins."
// RandomFameString :
"P1099304126" "I was watching WSPDR for this big special report they were hyping, but then they went off the air."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1643154497" "The jamming went up in time. Maybe. Still left us blind. We'll find out what the damage was. It'll take a few weeks. We've confiscated all of the evidence. We'll let the spies figure out who suspects what. Then there's Ms. Vines. I've ordered my men to have a little 'talk' with her. Discuss boundaries. What she can and cannot say. Nothing too severe. No marks for the cameras. It should make her even more determined, but reign her in some. She gets to live. <br>Me? I still get to crucify Aeon with what you found for me. That should keep him in line. For a while. <br>And you? I'll still pay you some. You earned it. Not that you were ever a part of this."
// RandomFameString :
"P808607701" "Don't tell anyone, but I saw something terrifying about 'Dr. Aeon' on the news the other night. Was I the only one?"

